{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>To inflict the vengeance of HaShem on Midian.</b> The Holy One, blessed be He, says 'the vengeance of the children of Israel,' and Moses says 'the vengeance of HaShem.' Moses said: Master of the universe, the vengeance is Yours, for the Canaanites do not hate us except on Your account. And therefore Israel went against the Midianites and not against the Moabites, because their measure was not yet full and their end had not yet come, as Balaam prophesied concerning them: 'I see him, but not now,' etc. And further, the Moabites acted out of fear, saying: perhaps Israel will think that our land is the land of Rephaim and will come upon us. And further, Israel took their land from the hand of Sihon."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:19.393840964Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}